    "title": "Castles Technology: UK Merchants Now Expect More Than Payment Acceptance",
    "summary": "New analysis from Castles Technology argues POS technology has become a business-operations platform, not merely a payment acceptance device.\nThe post Castles Technology: UK Merchants Now Expect More Than Payment Acceptance appeared first on The Fintech Times.",
