    "title": "UK Advised Platforms Record Best Quarterly AUM Growth Since 2020",
    "summary": "Assets under management on advised platforms rose 9.24% in Q2 2026, the strongest quarterly gain in six years, driven by market recovery and ISA\nThe post UK Advised Platforms Record Best Quarterly AUM Growth Since 2020 appeared first on The Fintech Times.",
    "hasSummary": true,
